sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant WE as Workflow Engine
    participant Planner
    participant Researcher
    participant Analyst
    participant IdeaGen as Idea Generator
    participant Writer
    participant Reviewer
    participant Tools as Tool Router + Registry
    participant LLM as Provider Router
    participant VDB as Qdrant
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Submit research topic
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /workflows {query, workspace_id}
    Gateway->>WE: Start workflow
    WE->>Planner: Execute(query)

    Note over Planner: ReAct Loop: Plan → Reason → Validate

    Planner->>LLM: Infer(search_strategy_prompt)
    LLM-->>Planner: ExecutionPlan
    Planner-->>WE: Plan with 6 steps

    WE->>Researcher: Execute(plan.step[0])

    Note over Researcher: ReAct Loop: Plan → Reason → Request Tool

    Researcher->>Tools: semantic_scholar.search(query, limit=50)
    Tools->>+Tools: Validate input, check cache
    alt Cache Miss
        Tools->>SS: HTTPS Request
        SS-->>Tools: Papers JSON
        Tools->>Tools: Normalize output, cache
    end
    Tools-->>Researcher: Normalized results

    Note over Researcher: Observe → Reflect → Refine query

    Researcher->>Tools: arxiv.search(query, max_results=30)
    Tools-->>Researcher: Papers JSON
    Researcher->>Tools: crossref.validate(dois)
    Tools-->>Researcher: Validation results

    Note over Researcher: Validate → Return

    Researcher-->>WE: PaperCollection (ranked + deduplicated)

    WE->>WE: Publish AgentCompleted(event)

    Note over WE: APPROVAL CHECKPOINT 1

    WE->>Frontend: WebSocket {type: "approval_needed", phase: "research"}
    User->>Frontend: Approve
    Frontend->>WE: WebSocket {type: "approve", checkpoint_id}

    WE->>Analyst: Execute(Papers + Topic)

    Note over Analyst: ReAct Loop: Cluster → Extract → Generate

    Analyst->>VDB: similarity_search(paper_embeddings)
    VDB-->>Analyst: Clusters
    Analyst->>LLM: Infer(theme_extraction_prompt)
    LLM-->>Analyst: Themes
    Analyst->>LLM: Infer(gap_analysis_prompt)
    LLM-->>Analyst: Gaps
    Analyst->>LLM: Infer(comparison_table_prompt)
    LLM-->>Analyst: Comparisons
    Analyst-->>WE: AnalysisReport

    Note over WE: APPROVAL CHECKPOINT 2

    WE->>User: Awaiting approval for ideas
    User->>WE: Approve Idea Generation

    WE->>IdeaGen: Execute(AnalysisReport)
    IdeaGen->>LLM: Infer(idea_generation_prompt)
    LLM-->>IdeaGen: Ideas
    IdeaGen->>VDB: overlap_analysis(idea_embeddings)
    VDB-->>IdeaGen: Overlap scores
    IdeaGen-->>WE: IdeaProposal (ranked with overlap)

    Note over WE: APPROVAL CHECKPOINT 3

    WE->>Writer: Execute(AnalysisReport + IdeaProposal)
    Writer->>LLM: Infer(writing_prompt, section_by_section)
    LLM-->>Writer: Draft with citations
    Writer-->>WE: PaperDraft

    WE->>Reviewer: Execute(PaperDraft)
    Reviewer->>Tools: crossref.validate_citations(dois)
    Tools-->>Reviewer: Citation validation
    Reviewer->>LLM: Infer(review_prompt)
    LLM-->>Reviewer: Review
    Reviewer-->>WE: ReviewReport

    WE->>DB: Persist all results
    WE->>Frontend: WorkflowCompleted(summary)
    Frontend->>User: Results dashboard
